{
  "info": {
    "name": "Panel Atletas",
    "description": "API collection for the Panel Atletas platform.\n\nOrganized by access level:\n- **Auth** — public endpoints, no role required\n- **Admin** — requires ADMIN_JWT (role = admin)\n- **User** — requires USER_JWT (any authenticated user)\n\nAll authenticated requests require a valid JWT in the Authorization header.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "version": "2.0.0"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "SUPABASE_URL",
      "value": "https://oduejasasklthjttssze.supabase.co",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "SUPABASE_KEY",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Publishable API key. Found in Supabase → Project Settings → API.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ADMIN_JWT",
      "value": "",
      "description": "JWT of an authenticated admin user. Obtain via Auth → Sign In.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "USER_JWT",
      "value": "",
      "description": "JWT of an authenticated regular user. Obtain via Auth → Sign In.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "USER_ID",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID of the target user. Used as a filter in PATCH requests.",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Public Supabase Auth endpoints. No role required. Used by any user to authenticate or manage their own session.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign Up",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/signup",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "signup"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"someone@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"xpQSRuBYgvUsMzUkdHSx\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Creates a new user account. Returns a session if email confirmation is disabled."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign In (Password)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"someone@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"xpQSRuBYgvUsMzUkdHSx\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Authenticates a user with email and password. Returns access_token (JWT) and refresh_token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Password Recovery",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/recover",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "recover"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"someone@email.com\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Sends a password reset email to the given address. User clicks the link and is redirected to the app to set a new password."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/user",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "user"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"someone@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"new-password\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Updates the authenticated user's credentials. Use only to change email or password. Do not use for profile data — that belongs in users_profiles via the Data API."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign Out",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/logout",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "logout"]
            },
            "body": { "mode": "none" },
            "description": "Invalidates the current session token. Client must discard the stored JWT after this call."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "description": "All endpoints that require an admin JWT (role = admin). Includes Edge Functions and admin-only Data API access.\n\nAll requests use {{ADMIN_JWT}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Invitations",
          "description": "Manage user invitations. Admin only.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Invite User",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/functions/v1/invite-user",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["functions", "v1", "invite-user"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"athlete@example.com\",\n  \"initial_role\": \"athlete\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Invites a new user by email. The Edge Function uses the Supabase Admin API to create the user in auth.users and sends an invitation email with a magic link.\n\nWhen the user clicks the link, Supabase verifies the token and redirects them to the app. The trigger `on_user_email_confirmed` automatically marks the invitation as `accepted`.\n\nFails with 409 if an active invitation already exists for the email.\n\n**initial_role** — one of: `athlete`, `admin`"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Resend Invitation",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/functions/v1/resend-invitation",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["functions", "v1", "resend-invitation"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"athlete@example.com\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Resends the magic link to a user with an existing non-accepted invitation. Resets expiry to 7 days from now and increments the attempt counter."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "List Invitations",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/users_invitations?select=*&order=created_at.desc",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "users_invitations"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "select", "value": "*" },
                    { "key": "order", "value": "created_at.desc" }
                  ]
                },
                "body": { "mode": "none" },
                "description": "Returns all invitation records. RLS restricts this endpoint to admins only."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Disciplines",
          "description": "Admin CRUD for the disciplines catalog.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get All Disciplines",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/disciplines?select=*&order=name.asc",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "disciplines"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "select", "value": "*" },
                    { "key": "order", "value": "name.asc" }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Create Discipline",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/disciplines",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "disciplines"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Natación\",\n  \"discipline_type\": \"individual\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Creates a new discipline. **discipline_type** — one of: `individual`, `team`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Discipline",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/disciplines?id_discipline=eq.1",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "disciplines"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "id_discipline", "value": "eq.1" }]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Natación Sincronizada\",\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete Discipline",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/disciplines?id_discipline=eq.1",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "disciplines"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "id_discipline", "value": "eq.1" }]
                },
                "description": "Deleting a discipline fails if any user is enrolled in it (FK constraint). Remove enrollments first."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Profiles",
          "description": "Admin access to all user profiles. RLS allows admins to read and update any profile.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get All Profiles",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/users_profiles?select=*&order=created_at.desc",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "users_profiles"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "select", "value": "*" },
                    { "key": "order", "value": "created_at.desc" }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Returns all user profiles. RLS restricts this to admins only."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Any Profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/users_profiles?id_user=eq.{{USER_ID}}",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "users_profiles"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "id_user", "value": "eq.{{USER_ID}}" }]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"is_active\": false,\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Updates any user's profile. Intended for admin operations like changing roles or deactivating accounts.\n\n**role** — one of: `athlete`, `admin`. Only admins can change this field."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Athletes",
          "description": "Admin access to all athlete records.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get All Athletes",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/athletes?select=*",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "athletes"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "select", "value": "*" }]
                },
                "description": "Returns all athlete records. RLS restricts this to admins only."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Medals",
          "description": "Admin access to all medal records.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get All Medals",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/medals?select=*,users_profiles(name,first_last_name)&order=year.desc",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "medals"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "select", "value": "*,users_profiles(name,first_last_name)" },
                    { "key": "order", "value": "year.desc" }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Returns all medal records with the athlete's name. RLS restricts this to admins only."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User",
      "description": "Endpoints accessible by any authenticated user. RLS enforces that each user can only read and modify their own data.\n\nAll requests use {{USER_JWT}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Catalog",
          "description": "Read-only catalog tables. Any authenticated user can read these. Data is managed via migrations, not through the API.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get Disciplines",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/disciplines?select=*&is_active=eq.true&order=name.asc",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "disciplines"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "select", "value": "*" },
                    { "key": "is_active", "value": "eq.true" },
                    { "key": "order", "value": "name.asc" }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Returns all active disciplines. Used to populate the discipline selector during enrollment."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Profiles",
          "description": "Read and manage the authenticated user's own profile.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Create Own Profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/users_profiles",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "users_profiles"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Brian\",\n  \"first_last_name\": \"Ramirez\",\n  \"second_last_name\": \"Arias\",\n  \"dni_type\": \"cedula\",\n  \"dni\": \"123456789\",\n  \"birth_date\": \"2000-01-01\",\n  \"sex\": \"male\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Creates the profile for the authenticated user. `id_user` and `role` are injected automatically by triggers — do not send them in the body.\n\n**dni_type** — one of: `cedula`, `dimex`, `pasaporte`\n**sex** — one of: `male`, `female`\n\nCalled once after the user first signs in via invitation link."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Own Profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/users_profiles?select=*",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "users_profiles"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "select", "value": "*" }]
                },
                "description": "Returns the authenticated user's own profile. RLS filters automatically — no id filter needed."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update Own Profile",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/users_profiles?id_user=eq.{{USER_ID}}",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "users_profiles"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "id_user", "value": "eq.{{USER_ID}}" }]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"profile_image_url\": \"https://example.com/avatar.jpg\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "Updates the authenticated user's own profile. RLS blocks updates to other users' profiles. The `role` field cannot be changed by regular users — only admins can update it."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Athletes",
          "description": "Read and manage the authenticated user's own athlete record.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Create Athlete Record",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/athletes",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "athletes"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+50688887777\",\n  \"district_of_residence\": \"san_pedro\",\n  \"nacional_games_participation\": false,\n  \"international_games_participation\": false,\n  \"weekly_exercise\": 3,\n  \"has_family_support\": false,\n  \"satisfaction_level\": \"satisfied\",\n  \"has_family_in_committee\": false,\n  \"has_previous_committee\": false,\n  \"previous_committee_name\": null,\n  \"is_club_member\": false,\n  \"club_name\": null,\n  \"facility_satisfaction_level\": \"yes\",\n  \"has_disability\": false,\n  \"disability_type\": null,\n  \"disability_description\": null,\n  \"has_functional_classification\": false,\n  \"classification_category\": null,\n  \"classification_document_url\": null,\n  \"accepts_data_usage\": true,\n  \"accepts_info_accuracy\": true\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                },
                "description": "`id_user` is injected automatically by the `set_athlete_id_from_auth` trigger — do not send it in the body.\n\n**district_of_residence** — one of: `san_pedro`, `sabanilla`, `mercedes`, `san_rafael`, `other`\n**satisfaction_level** — one of: `very_satisfied`, `satisfied`, `neutral`, `dissatisfied`\n**facility_satisfaction_level** — one of: `yes`, `no`, `partial`\n**disability_type** — one of: `physical`, `cognitive` (required when `has_disability = true`)\n**classification_category** — one of: `a1`, `a2`, `b1`, `b2`, `c1`, `c2` (required when `has_functional_classification = true`)\n\n`accepts_data_usage` and `accepts_info_accuracy` must both be `true` — the constraint `consent_required` will reject the record otherwise.\n\nFor athletes under 18, `legal_guardian_name` and `legal_guardian_phone` are required (enforced by trigger)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Own Athlete Record",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{SUPABASE_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{USER_JWT}}", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/athletes?select=*",
                  "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["rest", "v1", "athletes"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "select", "value": "*" }]
                },
